{
  "name": "Living Constellations",
  "promptTemplate": "A living constellation against a {{nebula_bg}} background, where stars are connected by {{line_style}} and drift at {{drift_speed}}x speed. Interaction distance is {{connection_radius}}px, stars are scaled by {{star_scale}}x, and they pull towards each other with a gravity factor of {{social_gravity}}.",
